{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Find My Wiener&quot;</strong> is a whimsical, hand-drawn adventure about one noble (and slightly ridiculous) quest: reuniting with your runaway wiener dog. This isn\u2019t just any missing pet \u2014 it\u2019s your four-legged best friend who\u2019s gone off on an adventure of their own! Expect a mix of humor, heart, and the untamed thrill of the hunt. Are you ready to answer the call of the wild and find your wiener?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Vast Landscapes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/12e5a011a4b34c62cd1d99cb49f0761c.avif?t=1755815646\" width=636 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across sprawling, hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from dense forests and pine groves to mushroom forests, open plains, and vibrant flower meadows. Every blade of grass sways in the wind, hiding surprises, secrets, and maybe\u2026 your elongated wiener.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/37bc63c9f006aeadc9068b9d5a4dbc6d.avif?t=1755815646\" width=636 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits with new difficulties, challenge yourself to beat your best times, and climb the <strong>leaderboards</strong> to prove you\u2019re the ultimate wiener wrangler. Along the way, unlock a growing list of quirky <strong>Steam achievements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Ups &amp; Poop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/10ad5792debcce38fde265b35bc783f1.avif?t=1755815646\" width=636 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your search into controlled chaos with bizarre power-ups and equally ridiculous debuffs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eggplant</strong>\u00a0<strong>Enhancement\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0Boosts your wiener\u2019s size for better visibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Toy</strong> \u2013 Points you toward your pup\u2019s location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poop</strong> \u2013 Yes, you can poop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Balls</strong>\u00a0<strong>Burst</strong> \u2013 Sends you soaring in random directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more strange surprises waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics, Relics, &amp; More</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/34cb629c569cf19ede8823200920cfca.avif?t=1755815646\" width=636 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through trees with fiery explosions, collect rare Relics that alter the rules of the world, and unlock cosmetics to jazz up your wiener. From silly crowns to hidden relic powers, secrets lurk around every corner to keep your journey unpredictable.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Natural Eggplant Enhancement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870660/7f4e15dccd1b0cffe749da64650edd9e8aa7e295.jpg"},{"name":"Hotdog Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870660/59eda000f8eb39a63e889e5ac1372666801b017b.jpg"},{"name":"Long Schlong Marathon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870660/2d2b2f9b64e5213285a413a7a1c6115e41a1d31