assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/10ad5792debcce38fde265b35bc783f1.avif?t=1755815646\" width=636 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your search into controlled chaos with bizarre power-ups and equally ridiculous debuffs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eggplant</strong>\u00a0<strong>Enhancement\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0Boosts your wiener\u2019s size for better visibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Toy</strong> \u2013 Points you toward your pup\u2019s location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poop</strong> \u2013 Yes, you can poop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Balls</strong>\u00a0<strong>Burst</strong> \u2013 Sends you soaring in random directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more strange surprises waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics, Relics, &amp; More</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/34cb629c569cf19ede8823200920cfca.avif?t=1755815646\" width=636 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through trees with fiery explosions, collect rare Relics that alter the rules of the world, and unlock cosmetics to jazz up your wiener. From silly crowns to hidden relic powers, secrets lurk around every corner to keep your journey unpredictable.</p>","developers":["JamCraft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/4a1d4604061b7ee260d4e34a88528907b1d0720f/header.jpg?t=1755815646","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>